  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "財富管理",
    "sub_ename": "WEALTH MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "學習正確有效的財富管理，掌握個人財富，規劃退休生活。通過思考現實狀態來建立投資組合管理概念。從實踐財富經理的角度了解經濟和金融、資產類別和市場、風險管理、稅收、退休和繼承。",
    "describe_eh": "To learn correct and effective wealth management to master personal wealth and plan for retirement. To build a portfolio management notion by thinking on real world problems. Understanding economics and finance, asset classes and markets, risk management, tax, retirement and inheritance from the perspective of a practicing wealth manager.",
